  {
   "id": "tiny-terry-s-turbo-trip-253106@1.925.2317",
   "gameId": "tiny-terry-s-turbo-trip-253106",
   "displayName": "Patch 1.925.2317",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-11-13T15:20:24.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello. I came back to fix a few things.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "You can now enable/disable the “Camera Smoothing” for gamepads in the Gameplay Settings. The setting is turned off by default, because a few people mentioned experiencing nausea due to the smoothing. The default behaviour should now feel familiar if you’re used to other games where the camera stops moving immediately when you release R-stick. If you liked the smoothing, you can turn it back on.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed an issue with cloud save files not working across different systems when their system locales were different (e.g. playing on your French PC and loading that save on a Steam Deck). Save files are now consistent no matter which system or locale you are using. The game should also still be able to read legacy save files in case you previously saved using a certain locale.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "fixed",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Vulkan rendering should now work properly on Windows again (see Patch 1.783.1129 Notes). I’ve kept the launch options for now because DirectX12 should theoretically remain more stable on Windows, but Vulkan is back for the extra FPS if you want it.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "If this update introduces any new issues for you, please let me know. And in the meantime you could always use the revert branch to go back to the previous version and finish your playthrough.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Cheers!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Lars (snekflat)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
