  {
   "id": "tiny-terry-s-turbo-trip-253106@1.33.1654",
   "gameId": "tiny-terry-s-turbo-trip-253106",
   "displayName": "Patch 1.33.1654",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2024-06-03T16:18:56.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello everyone!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Here's a bunch of changes, based on your feedback.",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Accessibility",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Gameplay Settings: Added a toggle for screen shake.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Gameplay Settings: Added a FOV slider.: Compatibility",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added DirectX12 support (Experimental). Vulkan still recommended if your graphics card supports it.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "new",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Added resolutions: 1280x800 (Steam-Deck), 1366x768: Graphics Setting: Shadow Quality: The quality of the shadows is now more customizable.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "To get the same quality level as before the update with shadows toggled on: set the Shadow Quality to High.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "To get the same quality level as before the update with shadows toggled off: set the Shadow Quality to none.: Balancing",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Lowered the price of most cosmetic items.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Increased the range of the Turbo Junk Finder Hat by 25%.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Earn an additional 15 Turbo Junk (or money) after defeating Ricky. The total amount of junk has not increased, Ricky will just run out faster.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Earn an additional amount of money after winning a soccer match, equal to how many goals you scored more than the opposite party.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Bumper Car Battle: You can now also hit Ricky's car if you released the Turbo button a bit early, but still have significant speed.: Fixes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed ending a phone call early in one of the late-game phone dialogues.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Implemented a fix in case a Turbo Trash Can doesn't come along with you after hitting it.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Can't go into screenshot mode anymore when looking through binoculars.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed Terry's head being deformed if you land on the ground right before picking up an item.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed that Terry's Car sometimes falls through the ground when using a parking sign.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed an issue where terry was able to hit Ricky's car once more after the battle ended.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed some issues regarding not being able to enter your car after battling with Ricky.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a few holes in the ground.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed the game displaying 100% before actually having all the turbo junk.: Other",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Implemented save file backups, as well as a feature that tries to revert a save file in case something went wrong during saving. If this happens through the main menu, gameplay should continue and you can try again.: Cheers!: Lars (snekflat)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
